        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium sulphate, from natural sources, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium sulphate, from natural sources, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of exploitation of naturally occuring sodium sulphate. Very large uncertainty of the process data, as only a mixture of different materials is included.;
UUID: 94818157-49f4-3a42-aadc-7fcba2e88229
Resource amount from estimated yield, energy consumption from a similar process (NaCl exploitation). Infrastructure and emissions, waste estimated.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: mixture of brine evaporation and further treatment - based on data of NaCl production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: estimations out of similar processes 
Extrapolations: see technology and geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_94818157-49f4-3a42-aadc-7fcba2e88229.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
